Article 3 (Contents of Medium-Term Basic Personnel Management Plans, etc.)
When formulating a medium-term basic personnel management plan under Article 14 (5) of the Decree, a superintendent of education shall include the following matters: <Amended on May 20, 2013.>
1. Plans for the allocation of personnel by personnel-management agency, category, grade and function;
2. Fields in which additional personnel will be appointed or personnel will be reduced, and details thereof;
3. Current status of personnel expenses;
4. Plans for entrusting affairs to the private sector.
